{
	"about": "The home page's loop of the studio at work (herostudio, recaptured by herostudio2, 2026-11-26): what src/dev/hero_capture_probe.gd plays in the real app and tools/site/hero_capture.py cuts into web/img/hero/studio-*. Each segment's setup is done unrecorded, then its steps recorded; segments meet by a crossfade (fade frames) unless one says join. speed takes every nth frame. caption names the words the page shows over it (web/landing.js CUE_WORDS); a segment with none keeps the one before. A little house and its tree (tools/site/hero_house.ldr) is built by hand on its plate, framed to stand at about 60% of the view when it is done; a set's steps play with the car fitted to the view; the car turns; then its render, made off camera (picture), is shown full-frame and pushed in slowly, and the loop fades back to the empty plate. Never a dialog, a form or a word of work under way: hero_capture.py refuses a cut whose words (texts.json) show one. bytes caps each cut's files at what herostudio's were.",
	"cuts": {
		"desktop": {
			"window": "1680x1050",
			"scale": 1.5,
			"out": [1440, 900],
			"bytes": {"av1": 1000000, "h264": 820000},
			"poster": {"segment": "drop", "at": "end"},
			"loop_fade": 18,
			"segments": [
				{
					"name": "drop", "caption": "drop", "speed": 1.5,
					"setup": [
						{"floor": "grid"},
						{"run": "new", "after": 30},
						{"lay": "res://tools/site/hero_house.ldr", "parts": 1},
						{"recent": ["3001", "3037", "3941", "3942c"], "after": 10},
						{"look": {"yaw": -0.61, "pitch": 0.5}},
						{"frame_on": "res://tools/site/hero_house.ldr", "margin": 1.0, "after": 60},
						{"glide": {"xy": [0.62, 0.5]}, "frames": 1}
					],
					"steps": [
						{"frames": 8},
						{"drop": "res://tools/site/hero_house.ldr", "from": 1,
							"pace": {"swatch": 10, "tile": 10, "glide": 14, "turn": 5, "wait": 2, "after": 5}},
						{"key": "Escape"},
						{"glide": {"xy": [0.86, 0.42]}, "frames": 14}
					],
					"hold": 24
				},
				{
